    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>作業評量依據：操作的認真程度、作業的完整性和美感。</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "1.準時上課。\n2.禁止課堂內飲食。\n3.教學示範可以錄影。\n4.作業可以補交。\n5.最好找同學一起來上課。\n6.到課前10分鐘，學生可以自行刷學生證開門。",
    "course_pol_en": null,
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>學生作業可以與他人討論與研習，但禁止將他人的作業完全拷貝交件。平常作業繳交准予遲交，但沒有繳交的項目，以零分計算。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>The&nbsp;Students of this class can discuss and study their assignments with others, but are prohibited from submitting complete copies of others&#39; assignments. Regular assignments may be submitted late, but any items not submitted will be given a zero mark.</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>Students must arrive in the classroom on time for class and practice the program carefully.</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": null
  },
